  (text "B3 — SIGNAL GENERATION: DAC8563 (0-5 V, internal 2.5 V ref) -> OPA2192 difference amplifiers -> AO1/AO2 = +-10 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3e0c1a72-20c5-5e30-b100-73bc9c49f878"))
  (text "DAC8563 logic thresholds are 0.7 x AVDD = 3.5 V at AVDD = 5 V, so a 74HCT125 (TTL-compatible inputs, 5 V outputs, tPD ~20 ns equal on all three lines) translates SCLK/DIN/SYNC (D-05)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7ced4a29-41b4-5788-a667-a44d545b63b6"))
  (text "AO_n = 4 x (DAC_n - VREF): R1 = R3 = 10 k, R2 = R4 = 40.2 k (1 %, gain 4.02): 0..5 V in -> -10.05..+10.05 V out; offset/gain calibrated in firmware via AI loopback. VREF drives 2 x 10 k (0.5 mA of the +-20 mA capability)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "40ab5ef4-ce57-5a1b-8d6f-4979e7959847"))
  (text "Output: 49.9 R back-termination, BAV99 clamps to +-12 V. OPA2192 short-circuit current +-65 mA: into a 50 R termination the swing is limited to ~+-6 V; full +-10 V into >= 1 k loads." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "418d2ca5-5757-5daa-9686-3c5db114720e"))
  (text "Gain = 2 is the DAC default once the internal reference is enabled by firmware (reset default: reference off, gain 1). /LDAC = AGND (synchronous), /CLR pulled up to +5VA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6946181b-8f52-543a-820a-8aef04b26739"))
  (text "SPI -> 5 V level shift for the DAC (three channels, 4th input grounded)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 44.45 146.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7ea91c00-2104-5b14-94dc-777ec9111be7"))
  (text "VREF 2.5 V out, 1 uF (>= 150 nF required by the datasheet)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 175.26 133.35 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "44d1c7d9-ac23-5795-9f9a-996ec6650d98"))
  (text "OPA2192 supplies +-12 V: 100 nF + 10 uF per rail to AGND" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 335.28 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "532c9c53-df12-5715-a62f-08c52c050051"))
  (text "AO_n = (1+R2/R1) x R4/(R3+R4) x DAC_n - (R2/R1) x VREF = 4.02 x DAC_n - 4.02 x 2.5 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 245.11 196.85 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "87fb14eb-c888-5eed-8428-5ce151951965"))
  (global_label "SPI_SCLK" (shape bidirectional) (at 62.23 97.79 180) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "b7ff5381-4d00-5cb6-b82e-0c5e6dcbf35c"))
